<title>JAPAN: Kaneko Seeds -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kaneko Seeds -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to November 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 15.60		vs	   14.52</p>
<p> Operating	  371    million	  vs	  354    million</p>
<p> Current	    368    million	  vs	  326    million</p>
